<section class="section-y relative border-t border-neutral bg-surface-0" id="faq">
  <div class="container-uwc">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[680px] text-center">
      <span class="mb-3 inline-block text-[0.78rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-text">COMMON QUESTIONS</span>
      <h2 class="text-[clamp(2rem,3.8vw,2.9rem)] font-black uppercase leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.01em] text-text-strong">Frequently Asked&nbsp;Questions</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-10 flex max-w-[860px] flex-col gap-3.5">
      <details class="collapse collapse-arrow rounded-box border border-neutral bg-base-200" open>
        <summary class="collapse-title py-[22px] pr-12 pl-[26px] text-[1.05rem] font-bold text-text-strong">Which grades can begin training?</summary>
        <div class="collapse-content max-w-[68ch] px-[26px] pt-0 pb-[22px] text-[0.94rem] leading-[1.6] text-muted">
          Kids in pre-K through 5th grade can begin training in our kids wrestling program. Practices focus on agility, tumbling, balance, basic stances, and listening in a supportive environment.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="collapse collapse-arrow rounded-box border border-neutral bg-base-200">
        <summary class="collapse-title py-[22px] pr-12 pl-[26px] text-[1.05rem] font-bold text-text-strong">What gear does my child need for their 3-day trial?</summary>
        <div class="collapse-content max-w-[68ch] px-[26px] pt-0 pb-[22px] text-[0.94rem] leading-[1.6] text-muted">
          For the 3-day trial pass, your child just needs comfortable athletic shorts (without zippers or pockets) and a t-shirt. Wrestling shoes are recommended but socks are acceptable for their first trial days. We provide loaner headgear if needed. Arrive 15 minutes early for check-in and gear fitting, and call (510) 303-4869 to confirm your first session.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="collapse collapse-arrow rounded-box border border-neutral bg-base-200">
        <summary class="collapse-title py-[22px] pr-12 pl-[26px] text-[1.05rem] font-bold text-text-strong">Are there contracts or cancellation fees?</summary>
        <div class="collapse-content max-w-[68ch] px-[26px] pt-0 pb-[22px] text-[0.94rem] leading-[1.6] text-muted">
          No. Memberships are month to month, with no contract and no cancellation fee. Monthly plans range from $89.99 to $150.00, depending on the program. See the pricing page for each plan.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="collapse collapse-arrow rounded-box border border-neutral bg-base-200">
        <summary class="collapse-title py-[22px] pr-12 pl-[26px] text-[1.05rem] font-bold text-text-strong">Where is the gym located and which cities do you serve?</summary>
        <div class="collapse-content max-w-[68ch] px-[26px] pt-0 pb-[22px] text-[0.94rem] leading-[1.6] text-muted">
          United Wrestling Club is located at 30139 Industrial Pkwy SW Ste C, Hayward, CA 94544, easily accessible via I-880 and Highway 92. We serve families and competitors from Hayward, Union City, Fremont, Newark, Castro Valley, and San Leandro.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
